  "created_at": "2026-11-08T18:11:26Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-08T18:11:44Z",
  "body": "> static classes are valid selectors for content projection, we should probably not regress on this.\n\nAgreed, and that’s kept: NG8031 doesn’t report static attributes, class included, on a node that a specific `<ng-content select>` slot selects. Slot matching includes class names, so `select=\".card-body\"` counts. A static class is reported only when no directive matches the node and no specific slot selects it, which is when it has no effect. I’ll add a test for the class case to #71882.",
  "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
